<h2 class="fw-semibold mt-4">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

<p><strong>Q1: How accurate is this ring size converter?</strong></p>
<p>
The converter uses standardized international ring size charts based on official jewelry industry measurements. While results are highly accurate, slight variations can occur depending on ring design and manufacturer.
</p>

<p><strong>Q2: Can I measure my ring size without a ring?</strong></p>
<p>
Yes. You can measure your finger using string, paper, or the printable ring sizing guide provided by this tool.
